# Machine-local RE / recovery scratch. artifacts/ holds IDA pack backups, carved
# probes and copied Windows binaries -- 5.1 MB of it defeated the *.i64 rule
# above via a rename (.i64.bak_1046pack) and would have ridden into a netcode
# commit under `git add -A`. If something under here is genuinely worth keeping
# in history it needs its own commit and its own decision about binary blobs,
# never a ride-along: force-add the single file.
artifacts/
